<title>NETHERLANDS: Gilissen maintains KNP BT as a Buy.</title>
<headline>Gilissen maintains KNP BT as a Buy.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Jan 27 research.</p>
<p>Company---------Sector--------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>    KNP BT	    paper	   40.50   Th. Gilissen Bankiers</p>
<p>    COMMENT: Buy.   EPS 1996 Dfl 2.25, 1997 Dfl 5.00</p>
<p>Company coming into vogue again after string of good news with respect to strategy and cost reduction. Better scope for higher pulp prices as of the second quarter of 1997 and more sympathy for cyclical stocks in general. Return to profitability of 70 percent owned Gelderse Papier will facilitate sale of this unit. We maintain positive stance on KNP BT and expect consensus 1997 EPS estimates to move closer to our 5.00 guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
